i-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"birth\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date created</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/3959_BBY\" title=\"3959 BBY\">3959 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"death\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date destroyed</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li>c. <a href=\"/wiki/3642_BBY\" title=\"3642 BBY\">3642 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Time&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Time-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Foundry&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Foundry-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <small>(Rebuilt)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-False&#95;Emperor&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-False_Emperor-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/3640_BBY\" title=\"3640 BBY\">3640 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Time2&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Time2-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-False&#95;Emperor&#95;4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-False_Emperor-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <small>(Copy later activated)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Shroud&#95;6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Shroud-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li>c. <a href=\"/wiki/3637_BBY\" title=\"3637 BBY\">3637 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Temple&#95;7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Temple-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Date&#95;8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Date-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <small>(Eventually rebuilt)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SWG:TTwH&#95;9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SWG:TTwH-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"creator\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Creator</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Revan/Legends\" title=\"Revan/Legends\">Revan</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"line\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Product line</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/HK-series_assassin_droid\" title=\"HK-series assassin droid\">HK-series assassin droid</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"model\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Model</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">HK-47<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"class\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Class</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Class 4 <a href=\"/wiki/Assassin_droid/Legends\" title=\"Assassin droid/Legends\">Assassin</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Protocol_droid/Legends\" title=\"Protocol droid/Legends\">protocol droid</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"height\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Height</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.8 <a href=\"/wiki/Meter/Legends\" title=\"Meter/Legends\">meters</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-DB&#95;10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DB-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gender/Legends\" title=\"Gender/Legends\">Masculine programming</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"sensor\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sensor color</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Color/Legends\" title=\"Color/Legends\">Orange</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"plating\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Plating color</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Rusty red<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K2&#95;11-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K2-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"armament\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Armament</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Integrated modular weapon mounts<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"equipment\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Equipment</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blaster_rifle/Legends\" title=\"Blaster rifle/Legends\">Blaster rifle</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Droid_Assassin%27s_rifle\" title=\"Droid Assassin&#39;s rifle\">Droid Assassin's rifle</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-CSWE&#95;12-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-CSWE-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Chronological and political information</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Revan/Legends\" title=\"Revan/Legends\">Revan</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Revan%27s_Sith_Empire\" title=\"Darth Revan&#39;s Sith Empire\">Sith Empire</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mandalorian_Neo-Crusaders/Legends\" title=\"Mandalorian Neo-Crusaders/Legends\">Mandalorian Neo-Crusaders</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hutt/Legends\" title=\"Hutt/Legends\">Hutts</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Senate/Legends\" title=\"Galactic Senate/Legends\">Galactic Senate</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Systech_Corporation/Legends\" title=\"Systech Corporation/Legends\">Systech Corporation</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Republic/Legends\" title=\"Galactic Republic/Legends\">Galactic Republic</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K1&#95;1-15\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Order/Legends\" title=\"Jedi Order/Legends\">Jedi Order</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Revan&#95;13-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Revan-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Meetra_Surik\" title=\"Meetra Surik\">Meetra Surik</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K2&#95;11-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K2-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/New_Empire\" title=\"New Empire\">New Empire</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-False&#95;Emperor&#95;4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-False_Emperor-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Malgus\" title=\"Darth Malgus\">Darth Malgus</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-False&#95;Emperor&#95;4-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-False_Emperor-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/HK-47%27s_Droid_Army\" title=\"HK-47&#39;s Droid Army\">HK-47's Droid Army</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SWG:TTwH&#95;9-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SWG:TTwH-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><small><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Droid\">[Source]</a></span></small></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>Recitation: Yes, as I said, I am an assassin droid. It is my primary function to burn holes through meatbags that you wish removed from the galaxy&#8230; Master. Oh, how I hate that term.</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;HK-47, to <a href=\"/wiki/Meetra_Surik\" title=\"Meetra Surik\">Meetra Surik</a>, on his functionality<span class=\"noprint\">&#160;&#8212; <img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/e/ee/Quote-audio.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250116042720\" alt=\"20?cb=20250116042720\" /> <span><audio hidden=\"\" class=\"ext-audiobutton\" data-volume=\"1.0\" preload=\"metadata\"><source src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/32/HK47-IAmAnAssassin.flac/revision/latest?cb=20250310004106\" type=\"audio/flac\" /><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/32/HK47-IAmAnAssassin.flac/revision/latest?cb=20250310004106\">Link</a></audio><a class=\"ext-audiobutton\" data-state=\"play\" title=\"Play/Pause\">\u25b6\ufe0f</a></span> <small>(<a href=\"/wiki/File:HK47-IAmAnAssassin.flac\" title=\"File:HK47-IAmAnAssassin.flac\">file info</a>)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-K2&#95;11-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-K2-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<p><b>HK-47</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/HK-series_assassin_droid\" title=\"HK-series assassin droid\">Hunter-Killer series assassin droid</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_hunter/Legends\" title=\"Jedi hunter/Legends\">Jedi hunter</a> constructed by the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Lord_of_the_Sith/Legends\" title=\"Dark Lord of the Sith/Legends\">Dark Lord of the Sith</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Darth/Legends\" title=\"Darth/Legends\">Darth</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Revan/Legends\" title=\"Revan/Legends\">Revan</a>, shortly after the end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mandalorian_Wars\" title=\"Mandalorian Wars\">Mandalorian Wars</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/3960_BBY\" title=\"3960 BBY\">3960 BBY</a>. In the wake of widespread destruction caused by the <a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Shadow_Generator/Legends\" title=\"Mass Shadow Generator/Legends\">Mass Shadow Generator</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Superweapon/Legends\" title=\"Superweapon/Legends\">superweapon</a> used during the <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_of_Malachor_V\" title=\"Battle of Malachor V\">final battle</a> of that conflict, Revan was inspired to seek more subtle methods of defeating his enemies. HK-47 was sent throughout <a href=\"/wiki/The_galaxy/Legends\" title=\"The galaxy/Legends\">the galaxy</a> on his missions and successfully <a href=\"/wiki/Assassin/Legends\" title=\"Assassin/Legends\">assassinated</a> countless targets whom Revan had deemed threats to galactic stability and peace. However, HK-47 was badly crippled and captured on a mission in <a href=\"/wiki/Mandalorian/Legends\" title=\"Mandalorian/Legends\">Mandalorian</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Realspace/Legends\" title=\"Realspace/Legends\">space</a> shortly before Revan himself was <a href=\"/wiki/Capture_of_Darth_Revan\" title=\"Capture of Darth Revan\">captured</a> by the <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Order/Legends\" title=\"Jedi Order/Legends\">Jedi Order</a>.\n</p>"}}